00:04:38.185 --> 00:04:39.268
I think of like a catcher's mitt.

00:04:39.268 --> 00:04:42.037
If you tell me something,
you come across this way,

00:04:42.037 --> 00:04:43.914
I'll grab it, and I'll look at it,

00:04:43.914 --> 00:04:45.367
and I'll think, okay, is it true?

00:04:45.367 --> 00:04:47.506
If it's true, cool, I'll
put it in and learn from it.

00:04:47.506 --> 00:04:49.213
If I think it's not true, cool,

00:04:49.213 --> 00:04:50.654
I'll throw it away, no harm, no foul.

00:04:50.654 --> 00:04:52.472
I'm not going to dwell on it, right?

00:04:52.472 --> 00:04:54.089
And I think everybody
needs this in this world

00:04:54.089 --> 00:04:56.381
because we're all on, most
of us are on social media,

00:04:56.381 --> 00:04:58.724
and we're all getting like,
