00:05:47.971 --> 00:05:49.751
you keep dismissing it,
at some point you say,

00:05:49.751 --> 00:05:51.653
"wait, maybe they have something."

00:05:51.653 --> 00:05:54.202
So one way I do this is

00:05:54.202 --> 00:05:56.968
I get together a group of
people, and we sit together

00:05:56.968 --> 00:05:58.332
