00:06:44.704 --> 00:06:47.441
For example, a lot of marketers
say to follow your audience,

00:06:47.441 --> 00:06:49.784
see what your audience wants,
and the problem with following

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:51.539
your audience, for those of
you who even have audiences

00:06:51.539 --> 00:06:53.942
already, I've seen it, it
can become a trap because all

00:06:53.942 --> 00:06:57.317
your audience knows is what
you've done in the past.

00:06:57.317 --> 00:06:59.696
They don't know what you're
going to do in the future,

00:06:59.696 --> 00:07:01.152
so if you're following your audience,

00:07:01.152 --> 00:07:02.605
you're already trapped.

00:07:02.605 --> 00:07:04.017
