00:08:11.039 --> 00:08:12.756
When they tell it to you,
don't take it personally.

00:08:12.756 --> 00:08:15.330
You think about it, and you
got to have this filter inside.

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.218
I think this is what allowed me to excel.

